2. Research Plan: I will prioritize 128 untested genes distributed across five functional categories: (1) TCR and co-receptor signaling (CD2, LCP2, PAK1, SLP76), (2) mTOR and nutrient sensing (MTOR, DEPDC5, PRKCD, TSC22D1), (3) NF-KB pathway regulation (RELA paralogs, IKB family, NFKBIA), (4) epigenetic regulators and chromatin remodelers (HAT family, HDACs, BAF complexes), and (5) interferon and IL-12 signaling amplifiers (STAT proteins not yet fully explored, IRF family members). This approach exploits the strong genetic signals already identified while systematically sampling pathway-adjacent genes that likely modulate IFNG production.

